i:p037","quote":"二十五年，晉文公卒。三十五年，共公卒，子文公壽立。文公二十三年卒，子宣公彊立。宣公十七年卒，弟成公負芻立。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-035","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai"}],"rationale":"曹幽伯彊在戴伯之前，曹宣公彊在文公之後，同國異代不合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji035-distinct-003","person_ids":["vs4_n7e_1qh_AAAAAAA","j2k_9wg_9q8"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p037","quote":"二十五年，晉文公卒。三十五年，共公卒，子文公壽立。文公二十三年卒，子宣公彊立。宣公十七年卒，弟成公負芻立。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-035","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p041","quote":"伯陽三年，國人有夢眾君子立于社宮，謀欲亡曹；曹叔振鐸止之，請待公孫彊，許之。旦，求之曹，無此人。夢者戒其子曰：「我亡，爾聞公孫彊為政，必去曹，無離曹禍。」及伯陽即位，好田弋之事。六年，曹野人公孫彊亦好田弋，獲白鴈而獻之，且言田弋之說，因訪政事。伯陽大說之，有寵，使為司城以聽政。夢者之子乃亡去。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-035","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai"}],"rationale":"曹宣公與後世曹伯陽時任司城的公孫彊為不同人物，不因單字彊合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p027","text":"三十年卒，弟幽伯彊立。幽伯九年，弟蘇殺幽伯代立，是為戴伯。戴伯元年，周宣王已立三歲。三十年，戴伯卒，子惠伯兕立。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m027-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"幽伯彊","kind":"person","person_id":"i5x_ejl_y1u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m027-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"幽伯","kind":"person","person_id":"i5x_ejl_y1u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m027-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"蘇","kind":"person","person_id":"7s2_h0m_msl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m027-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"幽伯","kind":"person","person_id":"i5x_ejl_y1u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m027-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"戴伯","kind":"person","person_id":"7s2_h0m_msl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m027-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface